  "description": "ADO-ASYNC, repeat of the timing boundary: Connection.Execute of a seven-way cross join (about 10^7 rows) with adAsyncExecute, run twice in turn; Connection and Recordset State right after return and after pauses of 100, 1000, 3000 and 6000 ms, then Errors, EOF and the count value (which waits for completion). No Cancel. Asks whether the early State is repeatable and how long the pending state lasts.",
